{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"还说不清\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里有股不肯停的劲，像是有事等着回应，却说不清等什么、为何不安，熟悉感又回来，过去也回不来了。\",\n      \"key\": \"不肯停的劲\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他还没缓过神，身体似乎先记得怎么往前，脑子却说不清该往哪走。\",\n      \"key\": \"身体先记得\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不甘心任由事情照旧，怕那等于认了只能这样，也怕真投进去会失去别的东西，想停又逼自己撑住。\",\n      \"key\": \"投进去会失去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想找理由往前走，每次快要想通，舍不得又回来，连刚有的确信也陌生了，他仍说不清舍不得什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"找理由往前走\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他为自己总要先想透才肯动而难堪。\",\n      \"key\": \"非得想透才肯动\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R1\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不肯停下的劲、熟悉感回返和过去无法回来，补出他仿佛在等回应却说不清所等为何、也说不清为何不安，覆盖B1和B2的无对象感与无名失落。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"补充\",\n      \"why\": \"补上熟悉感回来后身体先于意识产生向前牵引、头脑仍未弄清方向的过程，覆盖B3的身体与意识都未安顿，以及B4后半段的身体记忆。只写心理和身体的反应，不把听感中的场景写成真实往事或实际行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R2\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"找回上一轮反复丢失的意思：任由事情照旧，在他看来就像认了只能这样。同时保留真正投入可能失去别的东西的恐惧，并将B5的内在尊严与想停下的矛盾写成逼自己撑住、心里又想停的具体挣扎。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R3\", \"R4\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-3\", \"S01-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"将寻找理由、每次快要想通时舍不得又回来、连刚有的确信也变得陌生，收成一个反复发生的心理循环，恢复上一轮删掉的确信变陌生这一层。把由此产生的难堪单独保留，使它成为S02不再以想清楚作为等待理由的直接前因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ae30fc58-9727-4f78-a259-6e927d1edb8b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T002313631400Z", "elapsed_seconds": 189.344, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:26:22.989422+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "15a5938d2972db4749966fe5798e3a1734fff53d0e8fe7c23d8045427504407b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T002313631400Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "73102b6f2e94999aed32de7e1a4ac8b1f1efe341592d896dd3e661a2b7e791d5"}}}
